<title>NETHERLANDS: SGS Europe cocoa stock estimates down at end-Sept.</title>
<headline>SGS Europe cocoa stock estimates down at end-Sept.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>SGS Warehouse Services gave the following estimates of cocoa beans in store in Europe as of the end of September/early October. All figures in tonnes.</p>
<p>		     Total	  Of which for the buffer stock</p>
<p> AMSTERDAM	431,500		43,372.644</p>
<p> HAMBURG/BREMEN 102,750		15,512.218</p>
<p> UK (ALL PORTS)  44,000		 4,083.467</p>
<p> ROTTERDAM	 13,500		 9,740.066</p>
<p> ANTWERP	   77,000		 3,786.255</p>
<p>The data gives the following changes to month-ago totals</p>
<p> AMSTERDAM	  DOWN 40,000</p>
<p> HAMBURG/BREMEN   DOWN  9,550</p>
<p> UK (ALL PORTS)   DOWN  4,250</p>
<p> ANTWERP	    UP   15,750</p>
<p> ROTTERDAM	  DOWN  1,750</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
